style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">根据《广东省项目管理协会标准化管理办法》（</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-fareast-theme-font:\r\nminor-fareast;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;\r\nmso-bidi-theme-font:minor-fareast\">粤管协字〔<span lang=\"EN-US\">2022</span>〕<span lang=\"EN-US\">16</span>号<span style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">）</span>的相关规定，经<span style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">立项审查，团体标准《全过程工程咨询规范》符合立项条件，予以立项。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 28pt; line-height: 150%;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">请参加编制的单位和个人严格按照广东省项目管理协会团体标准编制工作要求及立项评审专家组意见，尽快组织标准编制，强化编制工作质量，加强组织协调，确保按期完成标准编制工作。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 28pt; line-height: 150%;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">如有单位或机构希望参与该标准编制工作的，或有单位或个人对立项项目存在异议<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>请在公告之日起<span lang=\"EN-US\">7</span>日内将意愿或意见书面反馈至广东省项目管理协会标准化管理办公室。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 28pt; line-height: 150%;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">联系人：谢添雄</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 28pt; line-height: 150%;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: ini